update public.outfits set title = $t$Relaxed autumn basics$t$, explanation = $t$The grey and brown sweatshirt with the blue pants creates a perfect neutral balance for a cloudy day at 16°C. The relaxed cut of the sweatshirt keeps you warm effortlessly, for a comfortable, super practical silhouette for your daily errands.

